00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:34.320
I have said we will wait until all shines again.

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:36.500
Then they die.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:01.060
Did I hurt you?

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:01.850
No.

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:04.850
Ian, I'm frightened.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:06.760
Try to hang on.

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:09.500
But how are we going to get out of this?

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:10.360
Jesus, I can't anymore.

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:13.870
I hope you can get yourself free, Chesterton.

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:14.920
I can't.

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:20.990
I'm sorry.

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:22.340
It's all my fault.

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:23.080
I'm desperate.

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:24.520
Oh, don't blame yourself, Grandfather.

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.140
Look at that.

00:23:30.990 --> 00:23:36.790
they're all the same they've been split open
